{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"b0ac41f5b9fc4ad5929991ec12211467","title":"使用入门","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V26","anchorList":[{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section39041435595","level":"1","title":"快速上手","showBeta":0,"apiAtomic":0,"deviceVersion":""},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section10871317164612","level":"1","title":"开发环境","showBeta":0,"apiAtomic":0,"deviceVersion":""},{"anchorId":"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section15960539132113","level":"1","title":"开发流程","showBeta":0,"apiAtomic":0,"deviceVersion":""}],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249\"></a>  <h1>使用入门</h1> <div><div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section39041435595\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section39041435595\"></a><a name=\"section39041435595\"></a><h4>快速上手</h4><p>在您正式开发应用之前，可以通过<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Examples/phone-samplecode-0000001050820291\" target=\"_blank\">示例代码工程</a>快速体验Wear Engine实现后的效果。</p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section10871317164612\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section10871317164612\"></a><a name=\"section10871317164612\"></a><h4>开发环境</h4><p><strong>手机侧</strong><strong>Android平台</strong></p> <ul><li><p>Android Studio 3.3.2及以上</p> </li><li><p>您的应用应满足以下条件：</p> <ul><li>minSdkVersion 23及以上</li><li>compileSdkVersion 34</li></ul> </li><li><p>测试应用的设备：手机为Android 6.0及以上版本且装有华为运动健康App（若为非华为手机，则需同时装有HMS Core（APK），并在手机设置界面的应用权限管理中，允许华为运动健康App在后台弹出界面）。</p> </li></ul> <p><strong>手机侧</strong><strong>iOS平台</strong></p> <ul><li><p>Xcode 12及以上</p> </li></ul> <ul><li><p>您的应用应满足以下条件：</p> <ul><li>最低支持iOS版本13及以上</li></ul> </li><li><p>测试应用的设备：手机为iOS13及以上版本且装有华为运动健康App。</p> </li></ul> </div> <p><strong>穿戴设备侧HarmonyOS平台</strong></p> <ul><li><p>HUAWEI DevEco Studio开发环境，请参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/tools_overview-0000001053582387-V3\" target=\"_blank\">DevEco Studio 使用指南</a>。</p> </li><li><p>测试应用的设备，请参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/service-introduction-0000000000018585#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951226__section14370945135215\">支持的设备</a>。</p> </li></ul> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section15960539132113\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001920110249__section15960539132113\"></a><a name=\"section15960539132113\"></a><h4>开发流程</h4><p>您需要按照流程来完成应用的开发工作，完整的开发流程如下。</p> </div> <p><span><img height=\"503.7375\" originheight=\"1125\" originwidth=\"1168\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/d5/v3/tYlwQz9RR4uI_efLu52IgQ/zh-cn_image_0000001874111114.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T160730Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=FA03CC895C5AA08B6203C0EA52BD626D68D40396FACEB6AA6E5398E9CA2007EA\" title=\"点击放大\" width=\"523.6875\"></span></p> <ol><li><span>注册成为开发者并完成实名认证。参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">注册账号及申请账号服务</a>。</span></li><li><span>开通账号服务并创建手机侧应用，填写应用信息（包名、证书指纹等），获取APP ID。参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">注册账号及申请账号服务</a>。</span></li><li><span>申请Wear Engine服务，并申请开通华为穿戴设备侧相关接口使用权限。参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/applying-wearengine-0000001050777982\">申请Wear Engine服务</a>。</span><p></p><div class=\"notice\"><span class=\"noticetitle\"><img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/03/v3/f7e3QDZJQcq2Qqox1PXf9Q/notice_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T160730Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=C9C70D00962BDA3BAB173C0721C3F1EEC5CBE9650197E0D6A1E0717E6FC9EF0B\"> </span><div class=\"noticebody\"><p>权限申请通过后才能走通后续的调测过程，否则会由于权限校验失败导致Wear Engine相关功能无法按照期望运行。</p> </div></div> <p></p></li></ol><ol start=\"4\"><li><span>手机侧第三方应用开发。</span><p></p><p>使用Android Studio开发环境，根据本手册指导，<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/integrating-phone-sdk-0000001051137958\">集成Wear Engine SDK</a>，完成手机侧第三方应用的Wear Engine功能开发。</p> <p></p></li><li><span>穿戴设备侧第三方应用开发（可选）。</span><p></p><div class=\"note\"><img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/50/v3/KFyKUikwR8SGLf70f5sahA/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T160730Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=E46A698A17A2EC759CFE25F0C327E5BBEDBEFAEB5AC659A96DA1C342EF0F0833\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span><div class=\"notebody\"><p>如需实现应用间消息通信（手机应用和穿戴设备侧应用互发消息和文件），则需要开发穿戴设备侧第三方应用。</p> </div></div> <ol><li>获取包含Wear Engine能力的华为穿戴设备（参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/service-introduction-0000000000018585#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001873951226__section14370945135215\">支持的设备</a>）。</li><li>使用华为<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/tools_overview-0000001053582387-V3\" target=\"_blank\">DevEco Studio工具</a>，根据穿戴设备应用开发指南（参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/lite-wearable-overview-0000001197577411-V3\" target=\"_blank\">轻量级智能穿戴设备开发</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/wearable-overview-0000001052065839-V3\" target=\"_blank\">智能穿戴设备开发</a>），开发穿戴设备侧第三方应用。<strong>注意</strong>：如果需要使用Wear Engine的“<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/wearable-device-notification-0000001057412109\">穿戴设备模板化通知</a>”功能，穿戴设备侧应用包名请勿超过28个字符。</li><li>根据本手册指导，集成穿戴设备侧Wear Engine SDK，并完成穿戴设备侧第三方应用的Wear Engine功能开发。</li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>从应用市场下载并安装华为运动健康App到手机。通过华为运动健康App完成穿戴设备与手机配对。</span></li><li><span>将开发好的穿戴设备侧和手机侧第三方应用分别安装在穿戴设备和手机上，调测验证Wear Engine功能。穿戴设备侧应用安装参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/run_fitnesswatch-0000001054134240-V3\" target=\"_blank\">在Lite Wearable中运行应用</a>、<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/harmonyos-guides-V3/run_smartwatch-0000001052902433-V3\" target=\"_blank\">在Wearable中运行应用</a>。</span></li><li><span>第三方应用上架华为应用市场。</span><p></p><p>手机应用参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/distribution/app/agc-help-releaseapkrpk-0000001106463276\" target=\"_blank\">发布应用</a>，穿戴设备应用参见<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-release-app-0000002271695230\" target=\"_blank\">发布HarmonyOS应用</a>。</p> <p></p></li></ol> </div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"dev-process-0000001051058039","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2026-10-10 04:06:01","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"],"showBeta":0,"displayUpdateTime":"2026-10-10 11:04:00","deviceVersion":""}}